  "text": "Skip to content\nOUR PRODUCT\nCUSTOM AGENTS\nREADINESS REVIEW\nLABS\nBLOG\n\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 EN\nBack to Labs\nPRODUCTION READINESS CHECK\nSHADOW AI AUDIT\nROI & COST OF DELAY\nAGENT REPLAY\n\nPRODUCTION READINESS CHECK\n\nCOULD YOUR AI PILOT GO LIVE? A CHECK IN ABOUT 3 MINUTES\n\nTen multiple-choice questions about your pilot. You get a status for each of the five gates a pilot has to clear before production, and the blockers most likely to stall go-live.\n\nThis check covers go-live controls, not the business case.\n\n10 questions \u00b7 5 gates \u00b7 no e-mail needed\n\nSTART THE CHECK\n\nWe do not keep your answers: they are scored in this browser and travel only in your result link. If an e-mail tool rewrites that link, it passes through our server to be restored, and our host\u2019s request log holds it for at most a day. We only keep anonymous daily totals of checks started, completed and calls booked from the result. Privacy policy"
